      "roles_v": 1,
      "summary": "Tuesday, May 19, 2026\nThe United States Court of Appeals for the First Circuit seeks applications from all qualified individuals for a 14-year appointment as United States Bankruptcy Judge for the District of Puerto Rico at San Juan. Please see the link to the full job announcement for more information and application requirements.\nThe United States Court of Appeals for the First Circuit - Employment",
      "summary_html": "<div class=\"field field--name-field-news-date field--type-date field--label-hidden\"><div class=\"field__items\"><div class=\"field__item even\"><span class=\"date-display-single\">Tuesday, May 19, 2026</span></div></div></div><div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden\"><div class=\"field__items\"><div class=\"field__item even\"><p>The United States Court of Appeals for the First Circuit seeks applications from all qualified individuals for a 14-year appointment as United States Bankruptcy Judge for the District of Puerto Rico at San Juan. Please see the link to the full job announcement for more information and application requirements.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ca1.uscourts.gov/employment\">The United States Court of Appeals for the First Circuit - Employment</a></p>\n</div></div></div>",
      "title": "Announcement - Bankruptcy Judgeship Vacancy, District of Puerto Rico"
    },
